# uv lockfiles are dev-env side effects: action images resolve deps from
# pyproject.toml at build time and never consume a lockfile, and the
# roboto-to-lerobot two-variant build (lerobot 0.3.3 vs 0.5.1) cannot be
# represented by a single lock. integration-example is the exception — a
# standalone runnable example whose committed lock helps users reproduce it.
uv.lock
!integration-example/uv.lock
.idea